   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{⚡ }\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{Trick:}}\\text{ all four numbers have the}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{digits }3-1-7-7,\\text{ so the }\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{mantissa is}}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{the same }(0.5019)\\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{. Only the}}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\textcolor{#047857}{\\textbf{characteristic}}\\text{ changes — count it}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{with Trick }7.\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Given: }\\log 3.177=0.5019\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{(characteristic }0,\\text{ mantissa }0.5019)\\end{aligned}\\]",
